# Security Tools Overview

## 1. Wireshark

Wireshark is a network protocol analyzer used to capture and inspect network traffic.

### Main Uses

- Packet capture
- Network traffic analysis
- Protocol identification
- Network troubleshooting
- Security investigation

### Task 1 Usage

Wireshark will be used to capture and analyze network traffic generated inside the authorized cybersecurity laboratory.

---

## 2. Nmap

Nmap is a network discovery and security auditing tool.

### Main Uses

- Host discovery
- Port scanning
- Service identification
- Network security assessment

### Task 1 Usage

Nmap will be used to scan the authorized laboratory target.

