### 3. Burp Suite

Burp Suite is a web application security testing platform.
Main Uses
- HTTP request interception
- HTTP response analysis
- Web traffic inspection
- Web application security testing
Task 1 Usage
Burp Suite will be introduced during Task 1 and used extensively during the later Web Application Security task.

### 4. Netcat

Netcat is a networking utility used for network connections, testing, troubleshooting, and network debugging.
Main Uses
- Network connectivity testing
- TCP/UDP communication
- Network troubleshooting
- Service interaction
